WEBVTT

00:00:03.770 --> 00:00:04.730
All right.

00:00:06.320 --> 00:00:08.030
I'm seeing things more clearly now.

00:00:09.030 --> 00:00:12.240
But what exactly happened to me back then?

00:00:14.070 --> 00:00:18.490
Wait, there was something
on the night Dad died...

00:00:20.870 --> 00:00:23.420
Here, have some cocoa.

00:00:24.040 --> 00:00:25.080
Okay.

00:00:26.420 --> 00:00:29.010
No, don't drink it!

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:35.680
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:38.640
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:00:38.810 --> 00:00:43.270
And the gears turn

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:56.160
When the horn blows, the flames dance

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:59.080
The story waits for no-one

00:00:59.240 --> 00:01:01.910
Off they go, the gears are churning

00:01:02.080 --> 00:01:05.250
A red past chases after you

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:07.540
The jester's smile

00:01:07.710 --> 00:01:10.420
What's behind the mask?

00:01:10.590 --> 00:01:13.220
You can't erase the scars

00:01:13.380 --> 00:01:16.140
No matter how they burn

00:01:16.300 --> 00:01:18.970
Let it bloom or let it wither

00:01:19.140 --> 00:01:21.970
The setting sun ignites the horizon

00:01:22.140 --> 00:01:27.690
Alone in the depths of the night

00:01:27.860 --> 00:01:31.820
Let out a cry that can cut through fate

00:01:31.980 --> 00:01:34.400
That's the cue to begin

00:01:34.570 --> 00:01:38.200
The curtain is rising, it's time to dance

00:01:38.370 --> 00:01:42.080
Everybody sheds tears at the end

00:01:42.250 --> 00:01:45.120
So hold them in now and keep going

00:01:45.290 --> 00:01:49.750
Until the day the curtain falls

00:01:49.920 --> 00:01:55.300
The gears will keep turning

00:02:03.220 --> 00:02:05.180
#20 Black sun

00:02:05.390 --> 00:02:10.520
I can finally get inside of you,
Masaru.

00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:13.440
I'm so happy.

00:02:14.070 --> 00:02:18.240
I hope Éléonore likes the new me.

00:02:23.580 --> 00:02:25.460
Shoji, you're alive!

00:02:29.670 --> 00:02:31.920
I won't let you take Masaru!

00:02:34.130 --> 00:02:36.880
Too bad. You didn't reach my neck.

00:02:37.050 --> 00:02:39.800
I never meant to.

00:02:40.430 --> 00:02:42.600
You can't download anything now.

00:02:43.180 --> 00:02:47.190
Don't be too sure. It's been a while
since I connected him.

00:02:47.940 --> 00:02:49.940
It may already be complete.

00:02:56.820 --> 00:02:58.280
Shoji, we're ready!

00:02:58.650 --> 00:02:59.910
Okay.

00:03:06.290 --> 00:03:07.830
Shoji!

00:03:08.290 --> 00:03:10.330
-Do it, he's in danger!
-Okay!

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:21.300
Sulfuric acid?

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:32.400
You bastard!

00:03:37.240 --> 00:03:39.320
No, I can't...

00:03:39.740 --> 00:03:42.780
I was so close...

00:03:52.500 --> 00:03:57.460
"FACE OF GIANT CORPORATION DIES..."

00:04:05.810 --> 00:04:07.010
You're back.

00:04:09.600 --> 00:04:11.690
You must've seen everything now.

00:04:11.850 --> 00:04:14.900
Shoji wants to know something
before I kill you.

00:04:17.320 --> 00:04:21.950
Did you figure out where the soft stone is
through my memory?

00:04:22.820 --> 00:04:25.990
Yes, it's in Shirogane's body.

00:04:26.870 --> 00:04:30.750
Now that you know that, tell me.

00:04:32.040 --> 00:04:34.880
How do you feel?

00:04:39.380 --> 00:04:41.510
I'm asking you how you feel!

00:04:51.640 --> 00:04:52.770
Why do you cry?

00:04:53.060 --> 00:04:55.900
Are you angry that you'll be killed here?

00:04:57.610 --> 00:05:01.070
Why... Why can't everyone...

00:05:01.900 --> 00:05:04.070
Why can't they all be happy?

00:05:05.450 --> 00:05:11.080
Grandpa, Dad, Angelina, Guy...

00:05:11.620 --> 00:05:15.040
Doll Francine, Shirogane...

00:05:16.170 --> 00:05:19.340
You all used to be normal people.

00:05:20.090 --> 00:05:24.800
But just one small gear
fell out of place.

00:05:25.510 --> 00:05:28.470
And created so much misery.

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:32.350
All everyone wanted
was a tiny bit of happiness.

00:05:33.180 --> 00:05:36.060
But that first bit of unhappiness
keeps growing.

00:05:37.230 --> 00:05:39.610
If this goes on...

00:05:40.650 --> 00:05:42.110
nobody...

00:05:43.110 --> 00:05:45.740
nobody can be happy!

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:51.830
So why don't you die?

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:55.790
Then at least my revenge will be achieved.

00:05:56.870 --> 00:05:59.880
Dad died in the sulfuric acid pool, right?

00:06:00.040 --> 00:06:04.760
The tanker crashed,
and the two drivers died.

00:06:05.010 --> 00:06:07.340
Shoji was miraculously saved.

00:06:07.510 --> 00:06:09.800
But Sadayoshi's body had disappeared.

00:06:10.350 --> 00:06:11.680
I'm Masaru Saiga!

00:06:11.850 --> 00:06:14.140
Time for you to finally die, Sadayoshi!

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:16.390
Can't have that.

00:06:19.900 --> 00:06:22.480
That boy is mine, you know.

00:06:23.440 --> 00:06:24.650
Daiki?

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.150
What's going on?

00:06:27.150 --> 00:06:28.660
I know now.

00:06:29.910 --> 00:06:33.160
Thanks to Shoji's memory
that the boy spoke about.

00:06:34.160 --> 00:06:38.170
But where's the memory of the key person?

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:39.170
What?

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.420
The Creator.

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:45.630
You mean, Bai Jin?

00:06:46.170 --> 00:06:47.630
That's right.

00:06:50.090 --> 00:06:54.810
My darling child

00:06:55.100 --> 00:06:59.730
My beloved child

00:07:00.060 --> 00:07:04.730
Just like the leaves

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:09.200
That dance in the wind

00:07:10.910 --> 00:07:13.780
Jin had fallen in love with Francine.

00:07:15.450 --> 00:07:17.790
But his big brother...

00:07:19.960 --> 00:07:23.790
Jin saw how truly happy Francine was.

00:07:24.210 --> 00:07:26.670
So he abducted her.

00:07:30.760 --> 00:07:33.930
Every time she tried to get away,
he hit her.

00:07:34.810 --> 00:07:37.930
Over and over.

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:42.560
Why can't it be me? I love you.

00:07:43.230 --> 00:07:45.110
I love you!

00:07:47.030 --> 00:07:50.700
I've abandoned puppeteering, alchemy,
even my own brother.

00:07:50.860 --> 00:07:53.820
All I have left now is you.

00:07:54.450 --> 00:07:56.410
Please, love me.

00:07:56.790 --> 00:07:59.870
Sing the lullaby for me!

00:08:04.590 --> 00:08:09.090
Heavenly... Father...

00:08:10.840 --> 00:08:15.850
Give one to this child

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:22.520
And one to each of us

00:08:23.270 --> 00:08:25.980
Someday, please

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:29.280
Bestow your blessing

00:08:32.110 --> 00:08:35.570
After that,
Francine obediently followed him.

00:08:36.910 --> 00:08:40.120
With eyes like a quiet lake.

00:08:41.410 --> 00:08:43.920
Clogue Village was a nice place.

00:08:44.420 --> 00:08:47.960
But Jin started to avoid Francine.

00:08:49.130 --> 00:08:52.800
Those quiet eyes
had begun to irritate him.

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:59.220
So he didn't stop the villagers when
they came to lock the sick Francine away.

00:09:01.100 --> 00:09:05.650
Before he knew it, she'd died all alone.

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:09.780
Jin decided to die in his hometown.

00:09:10.530 --> 00:09:16.160
But when he finally reached it
after many years, he realized something.

00:09:18.080 --> 00:09:21.000
He should take Francine's hair
off the doll,

00:09:21.160 --> 00:09:25.040
melt it into the Aqua Vitae,
and make another woman drink it.

00:09:25.210 --> 00:09:27.920
That way, he could reincarnate Francine.

00:09:29.630 --> 00:09:31.670
I've got to go back.

00:09:35.680 --> 00:09:38.850
He suddenly noticed how old he'd gotten.

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:44.230
His body wouldn't be able to do it.

00:09:44.390 --> 00:09:47.230
To walk back to France
and embrace a young girl.

00:09:47.610 --> 00:09:50.570
So he decided to be reborn himself.

00:09:53.400 --> 00:09:57.280
He melted his hair into the Aqua Vitae.

00:09:57.490 --> 00:10:00.330
And made a dog drink it
to become a shirogane.

00:10:01.120 --> 00:10:04.080
I have an important task for you.

00:10:04.710 --> 00:10:07.920
I will melt myself into the Aqua Vitae.

00:10:08.080 --> 00:10:10.540
You must make this boy drink it.

00:10:14.590 --> 00:10:18.550
It was a Bai boy
he'd kidnapped from his hometown.

00:10:19.180 --> 00:10:20.850
So it worked perfectly.

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:26.390
The road to Quiberon was full of hope.
Nothing was in his way.

00:10:28.150 --> 00:10:31.770
But when he got there,
the Francine doll was gone.

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:34.400
No...

00:10:34.570 --> 00:10:35.990
Who are you?

00:10:43.620 --> 00:10:46.370
F-Francine?

00:10:46.710 --> 00:10:49.420
You're calling me that too?

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:52.130
I know I might look like her.

00:10:52.460 --> 00:10:54.630
But I'm Angelina.

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.760
-Ange...
-Follow me.

00:10:56.920 --> 00:10:58.720
I'll introduce you to Mother.

00:10:59.640 --> 00:11:03.760
I'm so glad that a shirogane my age
has come.

00:11:04.260 --> 00:11:05.930
Shirogane?

00:11:06.270 --> 00:11:11.440
It turned out the shiroganes despised
the former him as an enemy.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:18.740
But nobody suspected the silver-haired
and silver-eyed boy.

00:11:20.030 --> 00:11:21.820
This is perfect.

00:11:21.990 --> 00:11:25.740
If I join them,
I can learn about Doll Francine.

00:11:26.620 --> 00:11:29.750
But for now, I'll just enjoy this time.

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:32.750
Oh yes, what's your name?

00:11:34.000 --> 00:11:37.260
I'm Dean. Dean Maistre.

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:45.010
As you know, this love will be broken
thanks to Shoji.

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:49.100
Who are you?

00:12:07.240 --> 00:12:10.000
Bai Jin. Dean Maistre.

00:12:10.620 --> 00:12:12.040
Sadayoshi Saiga.

00:12:12.670 --> 00:12:14.290
Commander Faceless.

00:12:14.710 --> 00:12:16.960
We are all the same person.

00:12:17.170 --> 00:12:20.260
The man behind ZONAPHA syndrome
and all your troubles.

00:12:20.670 --> 00:12:22.760
That's me!

00:12:24.640 --> 00:12:25.930
Sadayoshi!

00:12:26.430 --> 00:12:27.930
Dismantle.

00:12:33.310 --> 00:12:35.270
How useless you are.

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:38.440
Why are you here?

00:12:39.320 --> 00:12:42.910
I came to retrieve the body
I will be reborn into.

00:12:43.070 --> 00:12:44.070
What?

00:12:44.240 --> 00:12:47.120
You guys all had it wrong.

00:12:47.280 --> 00:12:50.040
I'm not inside that boy.

00:12:51.210 --> 00:12:52.580
You mean he's...

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:54.420
He's not you?

00:12:54.670 --> 00:12:55.960
That's right.

00:12:56.340 --> 00:12:58.670
He's still Masaru Saiga.

00:13:01.550 --> 00:13:04.430
-Olympia!
-Dissolve.

00:13:08.220 --> 00:13:11.180
-Guy!
-Masaru, forgive me...

00:13:11.350 --> 00:13:12.180
Run!

00:13:12.350 --> 00:13:14.600
-But...
-Give it up.

00:13:15.020 --> 00:13:16.690
I own you.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.940
I can do whatever I want with you.

00:13:20.280 --> 00:13:22.690
For you, I am a god.

00:13:25.910 --> 00:13:27.030
You're wrong.

00:13:28.280 --> 00:13:32.290
Those who are born in this world
belong to nobody.

00:13:33.540 --> 00:13:36.670
It's a god's job to make us.

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:43.720
But to stand, live, and die on our own
without being held up by strings.

00:13:44.420 --> 00:13:46.010
That's our job.

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:51.930
A vehicle is disobeying its driver?

00:13:52.350 --> 00:13:57.270
Even if you become me,
Shirogane won't love you.

00:13:58.150 --> 00:14:01.650
You can grasp nothing in your solitude.

00:14:04.190 --> 00:14:06.700
No, it'll work.

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.910
How can you be so sure?

00:14:09.450 --> 00:14:14.660
Because I believe in myself.

00:14:16.540 --> 00:14:19.420
Believe in yourself and follow your dream,

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:23.630
and it will definitely come true someday.

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:33.310
He doesn't think for a second
that he's doing something wrong.

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:37.560
Everything that's good for him
is justified in his eyes.

00:14:38.480 --> 00:14:43.320
Like a black burning sun.

00:14:44.530 --> 00:14:49.570
Burning everything in its path,
but still burning bright.

00:14:50.780 --> 00:14:56.910
If we let him go, we won't be
the only ones he burns.

00:15:05.760 --> 00:15:06.760
Now then.

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:11.760
It's time we end this.

00:15:19.900 --> 00:15:21.650
Don't!

00:15:21.810 --> 00:15:23.570
Farewell.

00:15:33.080 --> 00:15:34.200
Grandpa!

00:15:37.250 --> 00:15:39.460
My body sure doesn't give up.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:43.090
Masaru, leave me and fight.

00:15:43.790 --> 00:15:46.090
Raijin is in the bottom drawer.

00:15:48.340 --> 00:15:51.340
Now, you're coming with me.

00:15:59.940 --> 00:16:00.980
What happened?

00:16:01.400 --> 00:16:05.480
I punched him as I dodged his sword.

00:16:07.860 --> 00:16:12.200
Masaru can't run from his fate
to become me.

00:16:12.360 --> 00:16:14.780
There's no such fate.

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:17.290
What, huh?

00:16:17.450 --> 00:16:19.580
The download failed.

00:16:19.910 --> 00:16:22.750
But I have some parts of your memory.

00:16:23.250 --> 00:16:25.250
Your body is mechanical.

00:16:36.430 --> 00:16:41.350
We share a memory, but I'm much weaker.
So I'm alert to any chance I get.

00:16:44.150 --> 00:16:49.480
How fun! Then I'll hurt you just enough
that you won't die.

00:16:50.400 --> 00:16:52.400
Mr. Masaru!

00:16:54.570 --> 00:16:56.740
-Shirogane!
-Éléonore!

00:17:01.870 --> 00:17:03.250
Luck is with me!

00:17:05.880 --> 00:17:08.880
My beloved Éléonore has come to me.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:11.840
Let go! Don't touch her!

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:14.590
Masaru, let's play a game.

00:17:14.760 --> 00:17:17.470
No way,
I'm going to kill you right now!

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:31.740
It seems like you and Éléonore's bond
is stronger than anything, thanks to me.

00:17:31.900 --> 00:17:34.200
So this is a game of bonds.

00:17:34.450 --> 00:17:40.330
Either I download myself into you
and obtain that bond.

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:43.910
Or you come and take Éléonore back.

00:17:45.960 --> 00:17:49.380
I'll be waiting. You'd better come!

00:17:58.720 --> 00:18:00.640
What the...

00:18:02.770 --> 00:18:03.850
Who could've...

00:18:04.020 --> 00:18:07.310
I fed them to my pets.

00:18:08.690 --> 00:18:12.940
-I'm the wild beast tamer, Dr. Lao.
-Wild beasts?

00:18:13.740 --> 00:18:15.360
But those animals...

00:18:15.530 --> 00:18:16.950
You noticed?

00:18:17.570 --> 00:18:23.250
These legendary creatures are the results
of my experiments on a tiger named Beast.

00:18:24.790 --> 00:18:26.500
Beast, did you say...?

00:18:31.590 --> 00:18:33.670
Good day now.

00:18:40.850 --> 00:18:42.970
Grandpa, hang in there!

00:18:43.720 --> 00:18:47.270
You'll still call me that?

00:18:48.150 --> 00:18:49.810
Of course.

00:18:50.520 --> 00:18:52.440
Thank you.

00:18:53.020 --> 00:18:57.950
Then will you do one last thing for me?

00:18:58.160 --> 00:18:59.200
What?

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:02.990
Protect Éléonore for me.

00:19:06.410 --> 00:19:09.210
Don't worry, I'll protect Shirogane!

00:19:09.880 --> 00:19:13.550
I've become a lot stronger.

00:19:17.050 --> 00:19:20.010
So please...

00:19:21.090 --> 00:19:22.720
Don't die...

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:26.470
A man...

00:19:27.770 --> 00:19:33.820
must bear everything in his heart
and walk on alone sometimes.

00:19:34.650 --> 00:19:37.490
Clench your fist and look at it.

00:19:41.320 --> 00:19:44.030
It's the only thing in the world...

00:19:45.040 --> 00:19:51.040
The only fist in the world that can
save you and your loved ones.

00:19:53.670 --> 00:19:56.550
In my life...

00:19:56.710 --> 00:20:00.800
I had three truly happy events
happen to me.

00:20:03.050 --> 00:20:06.220
One is when I became Dr. Yin's apprentice.

00:20:08.140 --> 00:20:12.230
One is when I held Angelina in my arms.

00:20:13.560 --> 00:20:18.070
And one is when Éléonore was born.

00:20:19.650 --> 00:20:21.280
Grandpa...

00:20:22.410 --> 00:20:27.080
Now at the very end of my life,
a fourth has happened.

00:20:30.370 --> 00:20:35.960
That you called me "Grandpa"...

00:20:43.760 --> 00:20:45.100
Lucky them.

00:20:46.390 --> 00:20:48.770
Flying through the sky like that.

00:20:50.480 --> 00:20:55.860
Well, you can too if you wish to.

00:20:56.400 --> 00:20:57.480
Angelina.

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:01.240
You've been waiting for me?

00:21:01.400 --> 00:21:02.530
Of course.

00:21:03.700 --> 00:21:04.820
Well, well.

00:21:07.990 --> 00:21:11.790
But I've committed too many sins.

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:15.130
I can't go up to where you're going.

00:21:15.630 --> 00:21:20.460
That's why I'm going with you
to where you're going.

00:21:21.760 --> 00:21:23.720
Remember what you said?

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:27.300
How you'd walk through eternity with me?

00:21:29.430 --> 00:21:32.390
No, that's not what I said.

00:21:32.560 --> 00:21:38.150
I said I'd be with you forever
even when eternity is over.

00:21:39.230 --> 00:21:40.610
That's what I said.

00:21:45.700 --> 00:21:47.410
Yes, you're right.

00:21:48.370 --> 00:21:50.700
Let's go, then.

00:22:27.450 --> 00:22:31.990
Avoiding the crowds, I walk in the dark

00:22:32.160 --> 00:22:37.040
And wait with bated breath in the wings

00:22:37.210 --> 00:22:41.540
My expression is calm
while I scream inside

00:22:41.710 --> 00:22:46.590
On the verge of being torn apart

00:22:46.760 --> 00:22:51.300
I dance and beckon you to join me

00:22:51.470 --> 00:22:56.230
As a shadow swings across the stage

00:22:56.390 --> 00:22:59.150
I tell myself this is the last time

00:22:59.310 --> 00:23:05.240
But I can't seem to cut myself free

00:23:05.400 --> 00:23:09.950
Too scared to stop for a moment

00:23:10.120 --> 00:23:15.450
My impatience hides
the cries of somebody left behind

00:23:15.620 --> 00:23:23.670
Nobody notices the shadow
standing in the sudden rain

00:23:23.840 --> 00:23:31.680
Somewhere far away,
a memory of you is saying goodbye

00:23:31.850 --> 00:23:39.140
I stand here watching,
no longer able to reach you
